From e7397df8c3146f1777522a53c902e12813dadfb6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: urawazakun <30615262+urawazakun@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 16:53:41 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 16/17] Tail resume: keep a 40 KiB MTP boundary row on every
 conversation checkpoint and at the end of each request, so the next request
 resumes at the longest matching point instead of the last repairable
 checkpoint

---
